  <div id="sutta">
  
            <h4 id="thag1.14" class="h1">Thag 1:14  Vanavaccha’s pupil</h4>
            <div class="verse">
              <p>My preceptor said to me:</p>
              <p class="v2"><em>Let’s go from here, Sīvaka.</em></p>
              <p>My body stays in the village;</p>
              <p>my mind has gone to the wilds.</p>
              <p>Even though lying down,</p>
              <p class="v2">I go.</p>
              <p>There’s no tying down</p>
              <p class="v2">one who knows.</p>
            </div><!--end verse-->
      </div><!--end:sutta-->
    </div><!--end:content-->
    
